# promise: #472
# In full screen too: switching between spaces on different profiles shows only Cra, not Chromium's
# tab strip and toolbar over the page (#472, #486). In full screen Chromium moves them to an overlay
# window of their own, which a profile's hidden window doesn't make see-through.
# It takes over a Space, so it runs only with CRA_SCENARIO_SCREEN=1 (CI).
